5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's make sure we choose a place that balances our needs this year. I'll start by looking into time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, balance is lovely. I'll check what separately booked rooms cost last time and all-in rates against meals bought separately.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the bathrooms and the mealtimes. I'll look into bathing hours and bathroom provision and inn mealtimes and room arrangements.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'm interested in the travel time. I'll check ferry sailings and train time and getting around by train and bus.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses let whole and valley inn rates versus urban beds.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
