30,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems that staying in a house together can leave us with no privacy, but separate days can make us feel disconnected.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I've found that separate bookings can lead to very unfair price differences, while a single bill for a building is much more even.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minato,,The inns have very strict mealtimes and we'd all be in one room on futons. The island houses only have one bathroom and the water gets cold.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The ferry takes up two whole days of our trip. The train to the valley is much faster, and city transport is the most flexible.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Island houses are quite cheap per person, but the valley inns are more expensive because they include breakfast and dinner.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if the ferry takes two days, that's a lot of our limited time spent just moving.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, if the valley inn is all-inclusive, does that make the final cost easier to predict?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minato,,I'm worried about the one bathroom on the island. That sounds very stressful for a whole week.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Exactly, Mizuki. The travel overhead for the island is quite high compared to the train.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, yes, the all-in rate is predictable, but I wonder if it's fair for those who eat less.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, if the inn has everyone in one room, do you think that would be too crowded for you?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I think a single bill for the whole group is the safest way to ensure no one is quietly paying more.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think I'd prefer a room with a door and no strict timetable if possible.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"A city break would minimize the ""waiting"" time, which I really want to avoid this year.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Midori,,I'm leaning away from the city if the beds are expensive and meals are extra.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
