55,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have the Hot Spring Town, the Island Trip, or a City Break. I think the City Break offers the best balance of togetherness and privacy.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,The Island Trip seems the most equitable for the budget since the house is one bill.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,I really don't like the sound of the island bathroom or the inn's shared room. I vote for the City Break.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The City Break is the most efficient. No wasted days on ferries. I vote for the City Break.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'm worried about the city costs being unpredictable. I think the Hot Spring Town is a safer bet for the budget.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, but the city allows us to choose our own meals, which might actually be cheaper for some.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Minato, would the Hot Spring Town be okay? The baths are open very late.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minato,,The shared room with futons still worries me. I'd feel much better in a city hotel.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, the island takes too much time to reach. It's not worth the travel stress.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, that's true, but I prefer knowing the total before we go.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we go with the City Break, we can agree on a budget for the rooms beforehand. I vote City Break.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I see the concerns. I'll vote for the Island Trip because it's the most fair financially.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm sticking with the City Break. I need my own space to sleep well.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'm voting City Break. I want to maximize our actual holiday time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll vote for the Hot Spring Town. It feels like a proper group trip.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
